  "Vaṅga, Kaliṅga and Magadha (the east)": "Vaṅga, Kaliṅga ja Magadha (itä)",
  "Saurāṣṭra and Śālva (the west)": "Saurāṣṭra ja Śālva (länsi)",
  "the country of the Yamunā": "Yamunān maa",
  "between the Gaṅgā and the Godāvarī": "Gaṅgān ja Godāvarīn välissä",
  "Kaliṅga, Gauḍa and Gurjara": "Kaliṅga, Gauḍa ja Gurjara",
  "the Dagdha tithi (v. 66)": "Dagdha-tithi (säe 66)",
