  'The 1st, 3rd, 6th, 7th, 10th and 11th are the houses usually taken to suit; the 8th is the Candrāṣṭama to avoid.': '1., 3., 6., 7., 10. ja 11. talon katsotaan yleensä sopivan; 8. on vältettävä Candrāṣṭama.',
